4. RUNTIME CONTRACTS


---

4.1 EXECUTION GUARANTEES

All nodes must be reproducible from seed + rules

No persistent full-world storage allowed

All state changes must emit delta events

All redundancy must be compressible



---

4.2 PERFORMANCE RULES

Constraint	Rule

memory	O(active_chunks)
world size	unbounded
generation	on-demand only
storage	rule-set bounded



---

4.3 SAFETY / AEGIS CONSTRAINTS

prevent infinite recursion loops

enforce depth caps per chunk

validate rule consistency

block contradictory manifold transforms



